Changes made to the original code:

- Added the Bilinear Symmetry Penalty (BSP) regularizer in the loss files (losses.py).
- Added the configurations configs/bsp, configs/bsp_jvp (2d_examples) and configs/bsp_ncsn (real_world).
- Added run_experiments.py to train and evaluate several methods and datasets in one call.
- Replaced the TensorFlow-based data loading by NumPy (2d_examples) and torchvision (real_world).
